[[Roaring Ether (Depths of Tyria)|Roaring Ethers]] are found in the [[Depths of Tyria]], often accompanied by several [[Burning Spirit]]s. 

Unlike the [[Roaring Ether (Vabbi)|Vabbian versions]], they are non-[[fleshy]] creatures.

